      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CATCHAFIRE NZ (9) hasn't been too far from the placings in his two outings at Menangle since a spell. They will have brought him close to his peak and he drops to a distance that he loves, recording five wins and two placings from seven attempts. Draws on the back row but is nicely paced. RED SAPPHIRE (8) is back from a spell of five months and looks to be right up to the mark following a placing in a recent trial. May need luck from the second row but has usually goes well when fresh and strikes at 50 per cent at this circuit and distance so expect a bright start to the campaign. GO AWAY AGAIN (2) draws much better than last start and won the last time he raced at this venue. Last-start placegetter TIGER PRINCE (4) can feature again.",
